{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 9, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "大人", "id": "大人"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.9376005184609061, "source": "反", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.0176432261344426, "source": "反", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.2593563584432257, "source": "存", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 0.590199211307503, "source": "存", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.214867803470662, "source": "存", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.339399066116762, "source": "存", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 1.9339339580085977, "source": "存", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.816150922352214, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9984724791461688, "source": "行", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.5092981029121595, "source": "行", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 2.5092981029121595, "source": "行", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.199964782928397, "source": "義", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.403937587254333, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.403937587254333, "source": "義", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.403937587254333, "source": "王", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.8778812837592839, "source": "王", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.8094026953624978, "source": "心", "target": "大人"}, {"weight": 0.36705565999329326, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.6307476990208514, "source": "心"